codex
The waiver implementation is deliberately narrow: it only fires when Spike has an exception record at the first unrepresented instruction, the DUT has a trap-entry row for the same PC/instruction/cause/mtval, and the compared prefix is clean. Everything else still produces a divergence JSON.
